{
  "id": "9c7a49b1ab3b5df2469e0d80",
  "title": "Android 无障碍服务导致的整机卡顿案例分析",
  "summary": "现象 版本说明（2026-10-13 核查） ：这是 2019 年的历史案例，原文未保留",
  "content": "<h1><a title=\"现象\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>现象</h1><blockquote><p><strong>版本说明（2026-10-13 核查）</strong>：这是 2019 年的历史案例，原文未保留完整 Trace、ROM 构建号或相关应用版本。旧调用链以下文链接的 AOSP <code>android-9.0.0_r1</code> 为参照，不能据此认定原设备就是该标签；另补 <code>android-16.0.0_r1</code> 的差异。结论限定于当时的配置和观察，不代表所有无障碍服务或这些应用的当前版本。</p></blockquote><p>有用户反馈，手机在滑动的时候, 列表会一抖一抖的, 滑动桌面或者设置（只要是可以滑动的），都会出现，但是这个并不是必现，而是某些用户会出现，某些用户则不会出现。</p><p>吃瓜群众可以直接拉到下面看 罪魁祸首和自检 ，对分析问题比较感兴趣的可以看一下分析的过程。</p><h1><a title=\"Systrace 分析\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Systrace 分析</h1><p>本地测试有一台复现, 拿过来之后分析发现,手指滑动桌面或者设置,都会必现卡顿, 从 Trace 上看就是下面这样<br><img></p><p>红色箭头是我标出的更新间隔异常的位置。图中 Launcher 的 Buffer 供给有间断，但这张裁图没有完整帧时间和呈现信息，不能仅据计数认定 SurfaceFlinger 没有工作：没有新 Buffer 时，合成器也可能继续显示上一帧。</p><p>对应的 Launcher Trace 中，部分位置的输入处理与绘制活动出现间隔，提示可以沿输入路径继续查。它还不足以证明“这帧没有输入，所以必然没有绘制”；动画、惯性滚动和其他更新并不要求每帧都有新的触摸事件。<br><img></p><p>当时的现象发生在连续拖动中，所以我们先怀疑输入报点或交付延迟。不过触摸采样、事件批处理和显示刷新并非一一对应，不能要求每个 Vsync 都有独立的输入回调。检查硬件之前，先对照 InputReader 与 InputDispatcher 的活动：</p><p><img></p><p>图中 InputReader 仍有活动，而 InputDispatcher 的活动节奏不同于下面的对照。线程在运行并不能单独证明硬件报点和每个事件都正常，后面还需要核对事件时间与唤醒来源。</p><p><img></p><p>再回头看有问题的 Trace，我发现 InputDispatcher 的部分活动更接近 Vsync 节奏。这里应理解为这些事件经过了另一个交付路径，而不是整个 InputDispatcher 的所有唤醒都被 Vsync 接管。</p><p>我当时又点开调度详情，看到部分唤醒来自 system_server 主线程，而非 InputReader。当前保留的图没有展开这些 wakeup 详情，因此这里只能沿用当时的观察记录；要复核仍需完整 Trace，不能只凭两行切片对齐确认。</p><p>接下来从代码看，什么条件会让输入离开原来的直接入队路径。</p><h1><a title=\"代码分析\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>代码分析</h1><p>下面以 AOSP <code>android-9.0.0_r1</code> 的触摸 Move 路径为参照。这些是平台源码片段，不是可独立编译的应用示例；首段省略调试日志。源码中的 <code>needWake</code> 有条件判断，队列里已有工作时，不必每个事件都再次唤醒线程。</p><p><a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/native/+/android-9.0.0_r1/services/inputflinger/InputDispatcher.cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">InputDispatcher.cpp</a></p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br><span>33</span><br><span>34</span><br><span>35</span><br><span>36</span><br><span>37</span><br><span>38</span><br><span>39</span><br><span>40</span><br><span>41</span><br><span>42</span><br><span>43</span><br><span>44</span><br><span>45</span><br><span>46</span><br><span>47</span><br><span>48</span><br><span>49</span><br><span>50</span><br><span>51</span><br><span>52</span><br><span>53</span><br><span>54</span><br><span>55</span><br><span>56</span><br><span>57</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span><span>void</span> <span>InputDispatcher::notifyMotion</span><span>(<span>const</span> NotifyMotionArgs* args)</span> </span>{</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (!<span>validateMotionEvent</span>(args-&gt;action, args-&gt;actionButton,</span><br><span>                args-&gt;pointerCount, args-&gt;pointerProperties)) {</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>uint32_t</span> policyFlags = args-&gt;policyFlags;</span><br><span>    policyFlags |= POLICY_FLAG_TRUSTED;</span><br><span></span><br><span>    android::base::Timer t;</span><br><span>    mPolicy-&gt;<span>interceptMotionBeforeQueueing</span>(args-&gt;eventTime, <span>/*byref*/</span> policyFlags);</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (t.<span>duration</span>() &gt; SLOW_INTERCEPTION_THRESHOLD) {</span><br><span>        <span>ALOGW</span>(<span>&quot;Excessive delay in interceptMotionBeforeQueueing; took %s ms&quot;</span>,</span><br><span>                std::<span>to_string</span>(t.<span>duration</span>().<span>count</span>()).<span>c_str</span>());</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>bool</span> needWake; <span>//是否需要唤醒</span></span><br><span>    { <span>// acquire lock</span></span><br><span>        mLock.<span>lock</span>();</span><br><span></span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (<span>shouldSendMotionToInputFilterLocked</span>(args)) {</span><br><span>            mLock.<span>unlock</span>();</span><br><span></span><br><span>            MotionEvent event;</span><br><span>            event.<span>initialize</span>(args-&gt;deviceId, args-&gt;source, args-&gt;action, args-&gt;actionButton,</span><br><span>                    args-&gt;flags, args-&gt;edgeFlags, args-&gt;metaState, args-&gt;buttonState,</span><br><span>                    <span>0</span>, <span>0</span>, args-&gt;xPrecision, args-&gt;yPrecision,</span><br><span>                    args-&gt;downTime, args-&gt;eventTime,</span><br><span>                    args-&gt;pointerCount, args-&gt;pointerProperties, args-&gt;pointerCoords);</span><br><span></span><br><span>            policyFlags |= POLICY_FLAG_FILTERED;</span><br><span>            <span>// SystemServer 上层要对事件进行过滤</span></span><br><span>            <span>if</span> (!mPolicy-&gt;<span>filterInputEvent</span>(&amp;event, policyFlags)) {</span><br><span>                <span>return</span>; <span>// event was consumed by the filter</span></span><br><span>            }</span><br><span></span><br><span>            mLock.<span>lock</span>();</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span></span><br><span>        <span>// Just enqueue a new motion event.</span></span><br><span>        MotionEntry* newEntry = <span>new</span> <span>MotionEntry</span>(args-&gt;eventTime,</span><br><span>                args-&gt;deviceId, args-&gt;source, policyFlags,</span><br><span>                args-&gt;action, args-&gt;actionButton, args-&gt;flags,</span><br><span>                args-&gt;metaState, args-&gt;buttonState,</span><br><span>                args-&gt;edgeFlags, args-&gt;xPrecision, args-&gt;yPrecision, args-&gt;downTime,</span><br><span>                args-&gt;displayId,</span><br><span>                args-&gt;pointerCount, args-&gt;pointerProperties, args-&gt;pointerCoords, <span>0</span>, <span>0</span>);</span><br><span></span><br><span>        needWake = <span>enqueueInboundEventLocked</span>(newEntry);</span><br><span>        mLock.<span>unlock</span>();</span><br><span>    } <span>// release lock</span></span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (needWake) {</span><br><span>        mLooper-&gt;<span>wake</span>();</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这里 <code>filterInputEvent()</code> 返回 false 时，当前 <code>notifyMotion()</code> 跳过直接入队与本次唤醒。这表示过滤器接管了事件，并不等于事件永久丢失，也不是 InputReader 已停止运行。</p><p>继续看 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/services/core/jni/com_android_server_input_InputManagerService.cpp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">JNI 中的 filterInputEvent</a>：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span><span>bool</span> <span>NativeInputManager::filterInputEvent</span><span>(<span>const</span> InputEvent* inputEvent, <span>uint32_t</span> policyFlags)</span> </span>{</span><br><span>    <span>ATRACE_CALL</span>();</span><br><span>    jobject inputEventObj;</span><br><span></span><br><span>    JNIEnv* env = <span>jniEnv</span>();</span><br><span>    <span>switch</span> (inputEvent-&gt;<span>getType</span>()) {</span><br><span>    <span>case</span> AINPUT_EVENT_TYPE_KEY:</span><br><span>        inputEventObj = <span>android_view_KeyEvent_fromNative</span>(env,</span><br><span>                <span>static_cast</span>&lt;<span>const</span> KeyEvent*&gt;(inputEvent));</span><br><span>        <span>break</span>;</span><br><span>    <span>case</span> AINPUT_EVENT_TYPE_MOTION:</span><br><span>        inputEventObj = <span>android_view_MotionEvent_obtainAsCopy</span>(env,</span><br><span>                <span>static_cast</span>&lt;<span>const</span> MotionEvent*&gt;(inputEvent));</span><br><span>        <span>break</span>;</span><br><span>    <span>default</span>:</span><br><span>        <span>return</span> <span>true</span>; <span>// dispatch the event normally</span></span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (!inputEventObj) {</span><br><span>        <span>ALOGE</span>(<span>&quot;Failed to obtain input event object for filterInputEvent.&quot;</span>);</span><br><span>        <span>return</span> <span>true</span>; <span>// dispatch the event normally</span></span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>// The callee is responsible for recycling the event.</span></span><br><span>    jboolean pass = env-&gt;<span>CallBooleanMethod</span>(mServiceObj, gServiceClassInfo.filterInputEvent,</span><br><span>            inputEventObj, policyFlags);</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (<span>checkAndClearExceptionFromCallback</span>(env, <span>&quot;filterInputEvent&quot;</span>)) {</span><br><span>        pass = <span>true</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>    env-&gt;<span>DeleteLocalRef</span>(inputEventObj);</span><br><span>    <span>return</span> pass;</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>JNI 调回 Java 层的 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/services/core/java/com/android/server/input/InputManagerService.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">InputManagerService.filterInputEvent</a>。上面的对象创建失败或 Java 回调抛异常时，源码允许回到正常派发路径；不能漏掉这些返回 true 的分支。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>// Native callback.</span></span><br><span><span>final</span> <span>boolean</span> <span>filterInputEvent</span><span>(InputEvent event, <span>int</span> policyFlags)</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>synchronized</span> (mInputFilterLock) {</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (mInputFilter != <span>null</span>) {</span><br><span>            <span>try</span> {</span><br><span>                mInputFilter.filterInputEvent(event, policyFlags);</span><br><span>            } <span>catch</span> (RemoteException e) {</span><br><span>                <span>/* ignore */</span></span><br><span>            }</span><br><span>            <span>return</span> <span>false</span>;</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>    event.recycle();</span><br><span>    <span>return</span> <span>true</span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>本例关注 <code>mInputFilter</code> 为 <code>AccessibilityInputFilter</code> 的情况。<a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/services/accessibility/java/com/android/server/accessibility/AccessibilityManagerService.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AccessibilityManagerService.updateInputFilter</a>按启用功能组合 flags，非零时安装过滤器；不是任何一个无障碍开关都会启用同一条 MotionEvent 路径。</p><p><a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/core/java/android/view/InputFilter.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">InputFilter</a>先把事件投递到 Handler，下面第二段是 <code>H.handleMessage()</code> 中的分支。AccessibilityInputFilter 使用 <code>context.getMainLooper()</code>；图中 system_server 的主线程与单独名为 <code>android.ui</code> 的线程不要混为一谈。</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>final</span> <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>filterInputEvent</span><span>(InputEvent event, <span>int</span> policyFlags)</span> {</span><br><span>    mH.obtainMessage(MSG_INPUT_EVENT, policyFlags, <span>0</span>, event).sendToTarget();</span><br><span>}</span><br><span></span><br><span><span>case</span> MSG_INPUT_EVENT: {</span><br><span>    <span>final</span> <span>InputEvent</span> <span>event</span> <span>=</span> (InputEvent)msg.obj;</span><br><span>    <span>try</span> {</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (mInboundInputEventConsistencyVerifier != <span>null</span>) {</span><br><span>            mInboundInputEventConsistencyVerifier.onInputEvent(event, <span>0</span>);</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>        onInputEvent(event, msg.arg1);</span><br><span>    } <span>finally</span> {</span><br><span>        event.recycle();</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>    <span>break</span>;</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>继续看 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-9.0.0_r1/services/accessibility/java/com/android/server/accessibility/AccessibilityInputFilter.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AccessibilityInputFilter.onInputEvent</a>：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br><span>25</span><br><span>26</span><br><span>27</span><br><span>28</span><br><span>29</span><br><span>30</span><br><span>31</span><br><span>32</span><br><span>33</span><br><span>34</span><br><span>35</span><br><span>36</span><br><span>37</span><br><span>38</span><br><span>39</span><br><span>40</span><br><span>41</span><br><span>42</span><br><span>43</span><br><span>44</span><br><span>45</span><br><span>46</span><br><span>47</span><br><span>48</span><br><span>49</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>@Override</span></span><br><span><span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>onInputEvent</span><span>(InputEvent event, <span>int</span> policyFlags)</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (DEBUG) {</span><br><span>        Slog.d(TAG, <span>&quot;Received event: &quot;</span> + event + <span>&quot;, policyFlags=0x&quot;</span></span><br><span>                + Integer.toHexString(policyFlags));</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (mEventHandler == <span>null</span>) {</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (DEBUG) Slog.d(TAG, <span>&quot;mEventHandler == null for event &quot;</span> + event);</span><br><span>        <span>super</span>.onInputEvent(event, policyFlags);</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>EventStreamState</span> <span>state</span> <span>=</span> getEventStreamState(event);</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (state == <span>null</span>) {</span><br><span>        <span>super</span>.onInputEvent(event, policyFlags);</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>int</span> <span>eventSource</span> <span>=</span> event.getSource();</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> ((policyFlags &amp; WindowManagerPolicy.FLAG_PASS_TO_USER) == <span>0</span>) {</span><br><span>        state.reset();</span><br><span>        mEventHandler.clearEvents(eventSource);</span><br><span>        <span>super</span>.onInputEvent(event, policyFlags);</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (state.updateDeviceId(event.getDeviceId())) {</span><br><span>        mEventHandler.clearEvents(eventSource);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (!state.deviceIdValid()) {</span><br><span>        <span>super</span>.onInputEvent(event, policyFlags);</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (event <span>instanceof</span> MotionEvent) {</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> ((mEnabledFeatures &amp; FEATURES_AFFECTING_MOTION_EVENTS) != <span>0</span>) {</span><br><span>            <span>MotionEvent</span> <span>motionEvent</span> <span>=</span> (MotionEvent) event;</span><br><span>            processMotionEvent(state, motionEvent, policyFlags);</span><br><span>            <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>        } <span>else</span> {</span><br><span>            <span>super</span>.onInputEvent(event, policyFlags);</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>    } <span>else</span> <span>if</span> (event <span>instanceof</span> KeyEvent) {</span><br><span>        <span>KeyEvent</span> <span>keyEvent</span> <span>=</span> (KeyEvent) event;</span><br><span>        processKeyEvent(state, keyEvent, policyFlags);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>继续看 processMotionEvent</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>private</span> <span>void</span> <span>processMotionEvent</span><span>(EventStreamState state, MotionEvent event, <span>int</span> policyFlags)</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (!state.shouldProcessScroll() &amp;&amp; event.getActionMasked() == MotionEvent.ACTION_SCROLL) {</span><br><span>        <span>super</span>.onInputEvent(event, policyFlags);</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (!state.shouldProcessMotionEvent(event)) {</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    batchMotionEvent(event, policyFlags);</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>继续看 batchMotionEvent</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>private</span> <span>void</span> <span>batchMotionEvent</span><span>(MotionEvent event, <span>int</span> policyFlags)</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (DEBUG) {</span><br><span>        Slog.i(TAG, <span>&quot;Batching event: &quot;</span> + event + <span>&quot;, policyFlags: &quot;</span> + policyFlags);</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (mEventQueue == <span>null</span>) {</span><br><span>        mEventQueue = MotionEventHolder.obtain(event, policyFlags);</span><br><span>        scheduleProcessBatchedEvents();</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (mEventQueue.event.addBatch(event)) {</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>    <span>MotionEventHolder</span> <span>holder</span> <span>=</span> MotionEventHolder.obtain(event, policyFlags);</span><br><span>    holder.next = mEventQueue;</span><br><span>    mEventQueue.previous = holder;</span><br><span>    mEventQueue = holder;</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>继续看 scheduleProcessBatchedEvents</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>private</span> <span>void</span> <span>scheduleProcessBatchedEvents</span><span>()</span> {</span><br><span>    mChoreographer.postCallback(Choreographer.CALLBACK_INPUT,</span><br><span>            mProcessBatchedEventsRunnable, <span>null</span>);</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>它把任务安排在 Choreographer 的 <code>CALLBACK_INPUT</code> 阶段。何时实际执行还取决于主 Looper 调度；不能保证固定等一个 Vsync 后就完成交付。对应的完整 Runnable 如下：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>private</span> <span>final</span> <span>Runnable</span> <span>mProcessBatchedEventsRunnable</span> <span>=</span> <span>new</span> <span>Runnable</span>() {</span><br><span>    <span>@Override</span></span><br><span>    <span>public</span> <span>void</span> <span>run</span><span>()</span> {</span><br><span>        <span>final</span> <span>long</span> <span>frameTimeNanos</span> <span>=</span> mChoreographer.getFrameTimeNanos();</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (DEBUG) {</span><br><span>            Slog.i(TAG, <span>&quot;Begin batch processing for frame: &quot;</span> + frameTimeNanos);</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>        processBatchedEvents(frameTimeNanos);</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (DEBUG) {</span><br><span>            Slog.i(TAG, <span>&quot;End batch processing.&quot;</span>);</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (mEventQueue != <span>null</span>) {</span><br><span>            scheduleProcessBatchedEvents();</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>};</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>还要往下看 <code>processBatchedEvents()</code>。它只处理事件时间早于本次 <code>frameNanos</code> 的条目，时间大于或等于该值的剩余部分留给后续回调：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br><span>13</span><br><span>14</span><br><span>15</span><br><span>16</span><br><span>17</span><br><span>18</span><br><span>19</span><br><span>20</span><br><span>21</span><br><span>22</span><br><span>23</span><br><span>24</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>private</span> <span>void</span> <span>processBatchedEvents</span><span>(<span>long</span> frameNanos)</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>MotionEventHolder</span> <span>current</span> <span>=</span> mEventQueue;</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (current == <span>null</span>) {</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>    <span>while</span> (current.next != <span>null</span>) {</span><br><span>        current = current.next;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>    <span>while</span> (<span>true</span>) {</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (current == <span>null</span>) {</span><br><span>            mEventQueue = <span>null</span>;</span><br><span>            <span>break</span>;</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>        <span>if</span> (current.event.getEventTimeNano() &gt;= frameNanos) {</span><br><span>            <span>// Finished with this choreographer frame. Do the rest on the next one.</span></span><br><span>            current.next = <span>null</span>;</span><br><span>            <span>break</span>;</span><br><span>        }</span><br><span>        handleMotionEvent(current.event, current.policyFlags);</span><br><span>        <span>MotionEventHolder</span> <span>prior</span> <span>=</span> current;</span><br><span>        current = current.previous;</span><br><span>        prior.recycle();</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>需要继续交付的事件沿变换链到 <code>AccessibilityInputFilter.onMotionEvent()</code>，再经 <code>InputFilter.sendInputEvent()</code>、<code>InputManagerService.InputFilterHost.sendInputEvent()</code> 以 <code>FLAG_FILTERED</code> 标记异步注入 native 派发路径。过滤器也可能有意消费或变换事件，因此提前 return 本身不证明事件丢失。</p><p>因此，Android 9 这条路径中的主线程排队、批处理时间边界和后续派发，都可能增加输入交付延迟。它与我当时观察到的节奏变化相符，但不能仅凭代码断言每次开启该功能都必然掉帧，或者每个事件恰好多等 16 ms。下面的箭头仍是原案例标注：</p><p><img></p><h2><a title=\"Android 16 的路径变化\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>Android 16 的路径变化</h2><p>在 <a href=\"https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/android-16.0.0_r1/services/accessibility/java/com/android/server/accessibility/AccessibilityInputFilter.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AOSP <code>android-16.0.0_r1</code> 的同名类</a>中，<code>processMotionEvent()</code> 已直接调用 <code>handleMotionEvent()</code>，不再经过上面这组 <code>batchMotionEvent()</code> / Choreographer 队列：</p><figure><table><tr><td><pre><span>1</span><br><span>2</span><br><span>3</span><br><span>4</span><br><span>5</span><br><span>6</span><br><span>7</span><br><span>8</span><br><span>9</span><br><span>10</span><br><span>11</span><br><span>12</span><br></pre></td><td><pre><span><span>private</span> <span>void</span> <span>processMotionEvent</span><span>(EventStreamState state, MotionEvent event, <span>int</span> policyFlags)</span> {</span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (!state.shouldProcessScroll() &amp;&amp; event.getActionMasked() == ACTION_SCROLL) {</span><br><span>        <span>super</span>.onInputEvent(event, policyFlags);</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    <span>if</span> (!state.shouldProcessMotionEvent(event)) {</span><br><span>        <span>return</span>;</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span></span><br><span>    handleMotionEvent(event, policyFlags);</span><br><span>}</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>这个对比只能证明所核对的版本实现不同，不能据此确定首次修复版本，也不能证明所有现代设备都没有无障碍相关延迟。过滤、线程调度、具体服务逻辑及厂商修改仍需看实际系统。</p><h1><a title=\"罪魁祸首\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>罪魁祸首</h1><p>当时我们把触发条件定位到部分已启用的无障碍服务，在 Pixel 和其他厂商设备上都见过相似现象，涉及讯飞输入法和应用宝。由于没有保留对应 ROM、应用版本和完整对照数据，这里保留为 <strong>2019 年的案例记录</strong>，不把它写成这两个应用当前版本的检测结果。</p><p>无障碍服务用于帮助视障、运动障碍等用户操作设备，部分应用也使用它实现自动化。不同能力会启用不同输入处理功能，应按实际服务配置分析。下面是当时的设置页，列出服务不等于全部已开启，更不等于图中每个服务都与本例有关：</p><p><img></p><p>原文引用的权限弹框来自 <strong>Voice Access</strong>，不是讯飞或应用宝的数据访问记录。它提示这类能力可能接触敏感界面信息；不能据弹框断言某服务已读取所有密码、银行卡或聊天内容。能获得什么，取决于服务声明、系统版本、应用暴露的无障碍节点及字段保护。</p><p><img></p><p>Android 14（API 34）还提供 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/View\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>accessibilityDataSensitive</code></a> 等机制，限制未声明 <code>isAccessibilityTool</code> 的服务与敏感视图交互。这不是对某个服务可信程度的认证，也不能取代对具体应用和数据暴露范围的判断。</p><p>下面讯飞输入法弹框中的“执行手势”应与“监听手势”区分。它对应 <code>canPerformGestures</code> 能力；Android 7.0（API 24）加入的 <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/reference/android/accessibilityservice/AccessibilityService#dispatchGesture(android.accessibilityservice.GestureDescription,%20android.accessibilityservice.AccessibilityService.GestureResultCallback,%20android.os.Handler)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><code>dispatchGesture()</code></a>允许服务注入手势，不是仅订阅触摸通知。</p><p><img></p><p>Android 9 的 <code>updatePerformGesturesLocked()</code> 检查已绑定服务的 <code>CAPABILITY_CAN_PERFORM_GESTURES</code>，进而启用 <code>FLAG_FEATURE_INJECT_MOTION_EVENTS</code>，该 flag 属于 <code>FEATURES_AFFECTING_MOTION_EVENTS</code>。所以即使当时没有主动调用 <code>dispatchGesture()</code>，已启用服务的这项能力也可能让真实触摸走前面的过滤路径；放大、触摸探索等功能也可能进入相关路径，不能归结为一个通用“手势监听开关”。</p><h1><a title=\"自检\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>自检</h1><p>不需要的服务可以关闭，但不要为了排查而一口气关闭自己依赖的读屏、语音控制或其他辅助功能。若怀疑某项新增服务与卡顿有关，可以这样核对：</p><ol><li>记录机型、系统构建号、应用版本、启用的服务和具体复现场景。设置入口通常在“无障碍”中，名称和层级随厂商变化。</li><li>在不影响自己操作设备的前提下，一次只改变一个可疑服务的开关，重复相同的滑动场景，并恢复需要的功能。一次感觉变顺不能替代多次对照，也不要据此推出所有无障碍服务都有问题。</li><li>开发者用 Perfetto 等工具对齐输入事件时间、主 Looper 排队、InputDispatcher 派发和实际画面更新。Android 12 起可结合 <a href=\"https://perfetto.dev/docs/data-sources/frametimeline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FrameTimeline</a>，但它不能代替完整输入延迟分析；没有产生新帧的等待，也不一定直接表现为某个已生成帧的 deadline miss。</li><li>服务开发者只声明实际需要的能力，在目标系统上检查输入路径和性能。对于必须使用执行手势或触摸探索的辅助功能，应修复额外延迟，而不是简单要求用户停用。</li></ol><h1><a title=\"本文知乎地址\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>本文知乎地址</h1><p>由于博客留言交流不方便，点赞或者交流，可以移步本文的知乎界面<br><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/55585722\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">知乎 - Android 平台应用宝和讯飞输入法无障碍服务导致的全局卡顿分析</a></p><h1><a title=\"关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"></a>关于我 &amp;&amp; 博客</h1><p>下面是个人的介绍和相关的链接，期望与同行的各位多多交流，三人行，则必有我师!</p><ol><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/about/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">博主个人介绍</a> ：里面有个人的微信和微信群链接。</li><li><a href=\"https://androidperformance.com/2019/12/01/BlogMap/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">本博客内容导航</a> ：个人博客内容的一个导航。</li><li><a href=\"https://androidperformance.com/2018/05/07/Android-performance-optimization-skills-and-tools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">个人整理和搜集的优秀博客文章 - Android 性能优化必知必会</a> ：欢迎大家自荐和推荐 （微信私聊即可）</li><li><a href=\"https://www.androidperformance.com/2023/12/30/the-performance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Android性能优化知识星球</a>：付费社群已于 2026 年停止运营，不再招收新成员；此处保留历史介绍。</li></ol><blockquote><p><strong>一个人可以走的更快 , 一群人可以走的更远</strong></p></blockquote><p><img alt=\"微信扫一扫\"></p>",
